msgid "#### 5.2.1 1M Prefill-Decode Disaggregation (DCP)"
msgstr "#### 5.2.1 1M Prefill-Decode 分离（DCP）"

msgid ""
"This configuration uses GLM-5.3 W8A8C8 weights on four Atlas 800I A3\n"
"nodes, with 16 logical NPU devices per node. Use the A3 image from\n"
"[Docker Image Installation](#41-docker-image-installation) on all nodes.\n"
"The maximum context length is 1,048,576 tokens, including input and output."
msgstr ""
"此配置在四个 Atlas 800I A3 节点上使用 GLM-5.3 W8A8C8 权重，每个节点有 16 个逻辑 NPU 设备。在所有节点上使用 "
"[Docker 镜像安装](#41-docker-image-installation) 中的 A3 镜像。最大上下文长度为 1,048,576 个 "
"token，包括输入和输出。"

msgid "##### 5.2.1.1 Topology and Prerequisites"
msgstr "##### 5.2.1.1 拓扑与前提条件"

msgid ""
"| Role | Nodes | Global DP | TP | PP | DCP | Local DP ranks | Devices per "
"role |"
msgstr "| 角色 | 节点 | 全局 DP | TP | PP | DCP | 本地 DP rank | 每个角色的设备数 |"

msgid ""
"P0 and P1 run DP ranks 0 and 1. D0 runs ranks 0-1 and D1 runs ranks 2-3.\n"
"Prefill context parallel size is 1 on both roles. This DCP layout is\n"
"separate from the PP2 layout in Sections 5.1.2 and 5.1.3."
msgstr ""
"P0 和 P1 运行 DP rank 0 和 1。D0 运行 rank 0-1，D1 运行 rank 2-3。两个角色的 Prefill "
"上下文并行大小均为 1。此 DCP 布局与 5.1.2 和 5.1.3 节中的 PP2 布局不同。"

msgid ""
"1. Prepare identical weights on all four nodes and verify\n"
"   [multi-node communication](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-multi-node-interconnect).\n"
"2. Set `LOCAL_IP`, `NIC_NAME`, and `MODEL_PATH` separately on each node.\n"
"   Replace the master address placeholders in the startup commands with\n"
"   P0's IP for Prefill and D0's IP for Decode.\n"
"3. Reserve DP RPC ports 16591 and 16600, API port 8000 on each Prefill\n"
"   node, API ports 8000-8001 on each Decode node, and Mooncake transfer\n"
"   ports derived from the configured base ports 30000 and 30200.\n"
"   Run the public proxy on a separate host at port 8000."
msgstr ""
"1. 在全部四个节点上准备相同的权重，并验证\n"
"   [多节点通信](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-multi-node-interconnect)。\n"
"2. 在每个节点上分别设置 `LOCAL_IP`、`NIC_NAME` 和 `MODEL_PATH`。\n"
"   将启动命令中的 master 地址占位符替换为 Prefill 的 P0 IP 和 Decode 的 D0 IP。\n"
"3. 预留 DP RPC 端口 16591 和 16600，每个 Prefill 节点上的 API 端口 8000，\n"
"   每个 Decode 节点上的 API 端口 8000-8001，以及由配置的基础端口 30000 和 30200\n"
"   派生的 Mooncake 传输端口。\n"
"   在单独的主机上以端口 8000 运行公共代理。"

msgid "##### 5.2.1.2 Prepare the Scripts"
msgstr "##### 5.2.1.2 准备脚本"

msgid "1. prepare the script `launch_online_dp.py` on each node:"
msgstr "1. 在每个节点上准备脚本 `launch_online_dp.py`："

msgid "##### 5.2.1.3 Start the Engines"
msgstr "##### 5.2.1.3 启动引擎"

msgid ""
"Run these commands from the directory containing both scripts on each node.\n"
"The two Prefill commands use the same P0 master address, and the two Decode\n"
"commands use the same D0 master address."
msgstr ""
"在每个节点上，从包含这两个脚本的目录中运行这些命令。两个 Prefill 命令使用相同的 P0 master 地址，两个 Decode 命令使用相同的 "
"D0 master 地址。"

msgid "##### 5.2.1.4 Start the Proxy"
msgstr "##### 5.2.1.4 启动代理"

msgid ""
"After all six APIs become healthy, start the proxy on its separate host:"
msgstr "在全部六个 API 变为健康状态后，在其单独的主机上启动代理："

msgid ""
"Send requests to `http://<PROXY_IP>:8000` using the served model name "
"`glm-5`."
msgstr "使用所服务的模型名称 `glm-5` 向 `http://<PROXY_IP>:8000` 发送请求。"

msgid ""
"2. The following table shows the results of `GLM-5.3-w8a8c8` with Prefill-"
"Decode disaggregation."
msgstr "2. 下表展示了 `GLM-5.3-w8a8c8` 在 Prefill-Decode 分离下的结果。"

msgid ""
"| dataset | model | hardware | deployment | metric | mode | vllm-api-"
"general-chat |"
msgstr "| 数据集 | 模型 | 硬件 | 部署 | 指标 | 模式 | vllm-api-general-chat |"

msgid ""
"| GPQA Diamond | GLM-5.3-w8a8c8 | A3 | PD disaggregation | accuracy | gen | "
"91.92 |"
msgstr "| GPQA Diamond | GLM-5.3-w8a8c8 | A3 | PD 分离 | 精度 | gen | 91.92 |"

msgid ""
"| GPQA Diamond | GLM-5.3-w8a8c8 | A2 | PD disaggregation | accuracy | gen | "
"89.39 |"
msgstr "| GPQA Diamond | GLM-5.3-w8a8c8 | A2 | PD 分离 | 精度 | gen | 89.39 |"

msgid "## 9 Performance Tuning"
msgstr "## 9 性能调优"

msgid ""
"The following A3 W8A8C8 settings summarize the deployment scripts in\n"
"Sections 5.1.2, 5.1.3 and 5.2.1. Global DP includes all nodes of one role;\n"
"local DP is the number of ranks on one node. Each role uses 32 logical\n"
"NPU devices."
msgstr ""
"以下 A3 W8A8C8 配置汇总了第 5.1.2、5.1.3 和 5.2.1 节中的部署脚本。全局 DP 包含某一角色的所有节点；本地 DP "
"是单个节点上的 rank 数量。每个角色使用 32 个逻辑 NPU 设备。"

msgid "### 9.1 Detailed Node Configuration"
msgstr "### 9.1 详细节点配置"

msgid ""
"| Scenario | Role | TP | Global DP | Local DP | PP | DCP | Max Num Seqs | "
"Max Num Batched Tokens | Max Model Len | MTP Spec Num |"
msgstr ""
"| 场景 | 角色 | TP | 全局 DP | 本地 DP | PP | DCP | 最大序列数 | 最大批处理 Token 数 | 最大模型长度 |"
" MTP 推测数 |"

msgid "### 9.2 Performance Workloads"
msgstr "### 9.2 性能负载"

msgid ""
"The 0.30 RC performance reference covers the following workloads.\n"
"Lengths use `input/output` notation. The 1M A3 case uses one concurrent\n"
"request; reserve output tokens within the 1,048,576-token context limit."
msgstr ""
"0.30 RC 性能参考涵盖以下负载。长度采用 `输入/输出` 表示法。1M A3 场景使用一个并发请求；请在 1,048,576 token "
"的上下文限制内预留输出 token。"

msgid ""
"| Scenario | Input / Output | Prefix cache hit rate | Deployment reference |"
msgstr "| 场景 | 输入 / 输出 | 前缀缓存命中率 | 部署参考 |"

msgid "| Prefill-only | 16K / 1, 128K / 1 | 0% | Section 5.1.2 |"
msgstr "| 仅 Prefill | 16K / 1, 128K / 1 | 0% | 第 5.1.2 节 |"

msgid "| Decode-only | 16K / 1K, 128K / 1K | 100% | Section 5.1.2 |"
msgstr "| 仅 Decode | 16K / 1K, 128K / 1K | 100% | 第 5.1.2 节 |"

msgid "| Complete PD | 16K / 1K | 0% | Section 5.1.2 |"
msgstr "| 完整 PD | 16K / 1K | 0% | 第 5.1.2 节 |"

msgid ""
"| Complete PD, 1M context (A3) | Approximately 1M / 1K | 0% | Section 5.2.1 "
"|"
msgstr "| 完整 PD，1M 上下文（A3） | 约 1M / 1K | 0% | 第 5.2.1 节 |"

msgid "| Pooling | 128K / 1K | 90%, 32 distinct prefixes | Section 5.1.3 |"
msgstr "| Pooling | 128K / 1K | 90%，32 个不同前缀 | 第 5.1.3 节 |"

msgid "| Pooling | 40K-80K / 2.5K | Repeated prefixes | Section 5.1.3 |"
msgstr "| Pooling | 40K-80K / 2.5K | 重复前缀 | 第 5.1.3 节 |"

msgid "### 9.3 Optimizations Requiring Explicit Enablement"
msgstr "### 9.3 需要显式启用的优化"

msgid ""
"Combine enabled options in one `--additional-config` JSON object, as in\n"
"the deployment scripts."
msgstr "将启用的选项合并到一个 `--additional-config` JSON 对象中，如部署脚本所示。"

msgid "| Optimization | Scenario | Enablement | Purpose and constraints |"
msgstr "| 优化 | 场景 | 启用方式 | 目的与约束 |"

msgid ""
"| FlashComm1 | A3 Prefill | `\"enable_flashcomm1\": true` | Reduces TP "
"communication overhead; the Decode reference keeps it disabled. |"
msgstr ""
"| FlashComm1 | A3 Prefill | `\"enable_flashcomm1\": true` | 降低 TP "
"通信开销；Decode 参考配置保持其禁用。 |"

msgid ""
"| Fused MC2 | A3 PD | `\"enable_fused_mc2\": 1` | Fuses MoE dispatch, "
"computation and combine. Do not combine with shared-expert multistream "
"overlap. |"
msgstr ""
"| Fused MC2 | A3 PD | `\"enable_fused_mc2\": 1` | 融合 MoE "
"分发、计算与合并。请勿与共享专家多流重叠同时使用。 |"

msgid ""
"| DSA CP | A3 Prefill | `\"enable_dsa_cp\": true` | Distributes long-context"
" attention work; use the layout specified in each scenario. |"
msgstr ""
"| DSA CP | A3 Prefill | `\"enable_dsa_cp\": true` | "
"分散长上下文注意力计算工作；请使用各场景指定的布局。 |"

msgid ""
"| DCP | 1M PD (A3) | `--decode-context-parallel-size 16` on Prefill, `8` on "
"Decode | Shards KV cache across the TP group. Keep PCP at 1 and KV "
"interleave at 128 on both roles. |"
msgstr ""
"| DCP | 1M PD（A3） | Prefill 上使用 `--decode-context-parallel-size 16`，Decode "
"上使用 `8` | 在 TP 组内分片 KV 缓存。两个角色均保持 PCP 为 1、KV interleave 为 128。 |"

msgid ""
"| Int8 attention KV cache | A3 W8A8C8 | `--kv-cache-dtype int8` | Reduces "
"attention KV cache memory. |"
msgstr ""
"| Int8 注意力 KV 缓存 | A3 W8A8C8 | `--kv-cache-dtype int8` | 降低注意力 KV 缓存内存占用。 |"

msgid ""
"| Int8 indexer KV cache | A3 W8A8C8 | `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype "
"int8` | Quantizes the indexer cache separately from the attention cache. |"
msgstr ""
"| Int8 indexer KV 缓存 | A3 W8A8C8 | `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype "
"int8` | 将 indexer 缓存与注意力缓存分开量化。 |"

msgid ""
"| MLAPO | A3 1M Decode | `\"enable_mlapo\": true` | Fuses MLA preprocessing;"
" account for its memory requirements. |"
msgstr ""
"| MLAPO | A3 1M Decode | `\"enable_mlapo\": true` | 融合 MLA 预处理；请考虑其内存需求。 |"

msgid ""
"| Recompute scheduler | A3 Decode | `\"recompute_scheduler_enable\": true` |"
" Enables Prefill-side recomputation when Decode KV cache capacity is "
"insufficient. |"
msgstr ""
"| 重计算调度器 | A3 Decode | `\"recompute_scheduler_enable\": true` | 当 Decode KV "
"缓存容量不足时启用 Prefill 侧重计算。 |"

msgid ""
"| Decode graph | A3 Decode | `--compilation-config "
"'{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` | Captures Decode execution; "
"the reference Prefill uses eager mode. |"
msgstr ""
"| Decode graph | A3 Decode | `--compilation-config "
"'{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` | 捕获 Decode 执行过程；参考 Prefill 使用 "
"eager 模式。 |"

msgid ""
"| KV pooling | Repeated-prefix PD | Ascend Store/MemCache configuration in "
"Section 5.1.3 | Reuses KV across requests and engines; confirm pool hits in "
"backend metrics. |"
msgstr ""
"| KV pooling | 重复前缀 PD | 第 5.1.3 节中的昇腾 Store/MemCache 配置 | 跨请求和引擎复用 "
"KV；请在后端指标中确认池命中情况。 |"

msgid ""
"The \"PD Separation Deployment\" mentioned in this document is provided only"
" as an example/reference design to demonstrate the basic process of "
"deploying Prefill and Decode in separated mode. It is not recommended for "
"use in the production environment."
msgstr ""
"本文档中提到的“PD 分离部署”仅作为示例/参考设计提供，用于演示以分离模式部署 Prefill 和 Decode 的基本流程。不建议在生产环境中使用。"

msgid ""
"**For the production environment on the customer side, [MindIE "
"Motor](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/en/mindie/latest/quickstart/docs/en/user_guide/quick_start.md)"
" + vLLM-Ascend is recommended.**"
msgstr ""
"**对于客户侧的生产环境，推荐使用 [MindIE "
"Motor](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/en/mindie/latest/quickstart/docs/en/user_guide/quick_start.md)"
" + vLLM-Ascend。**"

msgid "**A3 network and data parallel configuration:**"
msgstr "**A3 网络与数据并行配置：**"

msgid ""
"- `HCCL_IF_IP`, `GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`, `TP_SOCKET_IFNAME`, `HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME`: Network interface configuration for multi-node communication. Set `nic_name` to the network interface name (obtained via `ifconfig`) and `local_ip` to the current node's IP address. These must be correctly configured on each node for successful multi-node communication.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-size 8`: Total number of data parallel ranks across all nodes (4 ranks per node in this scenario).\n"
"- `--data-parallel-size-local 4`: Number of data parallel ranks on the current node.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-start-rank`: Starting rank offset for data parallel ranks on this node. Node 0 uses `0`, node 1 uses `4`.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-address`: IP address of the data parallel master node (node 0). Must match the `local_ip` of the master node.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-rpc-port 12980`: RPC port for data parallel master communication. Must be the same across all nodes.\n"
"- `--headless`: Used on node 1. Node 0 hosts the API server."
msgstr ""
"- `HCCL_IF_IP`、`GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`、`TP_SOCKET_IFNAME`、`HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME`：多节点通信的网络接口配置。将 `nic_name` 设置为网络接口名称（可通过 `ifconfig` 获取），将 `local_ip` 设置为当前节点的 IP 地址。必须在每个节点上正确配置这些参数，才能成功进行多节点通信。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-size 8`：所有节点上的数据并行 rank 总数（本场景中每个节点 4 个 rank）。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-size-local 4`：当前节点上的数据并行 rank 数量。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-start-rank`：当前节点上数据并行 rank 的起始 rank 偏移量。节点 0 使用 `0`，节点 1 使用 `4`。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-address`：数据并行主节点（节点 0）的 IP 地址。必须与主节点的 `local_ip` 一致。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-rpc-port 12980`：数据并行主节点通信的 RPC 端口。所有节点必须保持一致。\n"
"- `--headless`：在节点 1 上使用。节点 0 承载 API 服务器。"

msgid "**A2 four-node network and data parallel configuration:**"
msgstr "**A2 四节点网络与数据并行配置：**"

msgid ""
"- `HCCL_IF_IP`, `GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`, `TP_SOCKET_IFNAME`, and\n"
"  `HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME`: Set each node's local IP and matching network\n"
"  interface for multi-node communication.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-size 4`: Four global DP ranks, one per A2 node.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-size-local 1`: One local DP rank per node, using TP8.\n"
"- Node 0 hosts the API and omits `--data-parallel-start-rank`, so rank 0\n"
"  is inferred automatically. Nodes 1-3 use `--headless` and explicitly\n"
"  set `--data-parallel-start-rank` to 1, 2, and 3, respectively.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-address`: Node 0's IP, shared by all four nodes.\n"
"  `--data-parallel-rpc-port 12980` must also match on every node."
msgstr ""
"- `HCCL_IF_IP`、`GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`、`TP_SOCKET_IFNAME` 和\n"
"  `HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME`：为多节点通信设置每个节点的本地 IP 和匹配的\n"
"  网络接口。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-size 4`：四个全局 DP rank，每个 A2 节点一个。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-size-local 1`：每个节点一个本地 DP rank，使用 TP8。\n"
"- 节点 0 承载 API 并省略 `--data-parallel-start-rank`，因此 rank 0\n"
"  会被自动推断。节点 1-3 使用 `--headless` 并分别显式\n"
"  将 `--data-parallel-start-rank` 设置为 1、2 和 3。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-address`：节点 0 的 IP，由所有四个节点共享。\n"
"  每个节点上的 `--data-parallel-rpc-port 12980` 也必须一致。"

msgid ""
"On v0.30.0rc1, explicitly setting `--data-parallel-start-rank 0` on the\n"
"API node triggers external/hybrid DP load-balancing inference. The remote\n"
"headless engines are then rejected with\n"
"`Remote engine must not use --headless in external or hybrid dp lb mode`.\n"
"Keep the API node's rank implicit so all four EngineCores join the same\n"
"DP group."
msgstr ""
"在 v0.30.0rc1 上，在 API 节点上显式设置 `--data-parallel-start-rank 0` 会触发\n"
"外部/混合 DP 负载均衡推断。此时远程\n"
"headless 引擎会被拒绝，并报错\n"
"`Remote engine must not use --headless in external or hybrid dp lb mode`。\n"
"请保持 API 节点的 rank 为隐式，以便所有四个 EngineCore 加入同一个\n"
"DP 组。"

msgid ""
"Use `scheduler_config.enable_balance_scheduling` and\n"
"`ascend_compilation_config.fuse_muls_add` inside `--additional-config`.\n"
"The former replaces the deprecated top-level scheduler setting; the\n"
"latter is the configuration level required by v0.30.0rc1."
msgstr ""
"在 `--additional-config` 中使用 `scheduler_config.enable_balance_scheduling` 和\n"
"`ascend_compilation_config.fuse_muls_add`。\n"
"前者替代了已弃用的顶层调度器设置；\n"
"后者是 v0.30.0rc1 所要求的配置层级。"

msgid ""
"- `CPU_AFFINITY_CONF=1`: Enables CPU core affinity binding for worker processes.\n"
"- `ACL_OP_INIT_MODE=1`: ACL operator initialization mode to speed up operator compilation.\n"
"- `VLLM_RPC_TIMEOUT=360000` / `VLLM_EXECUTE_MODEL_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=30000` / `HCCL_EXEC_TIMEOUT=200` / `HCCL_CONNECT_TIMEOUT=120` / `VLLM_ENGINE_READY_TIMEOUT_S=1200`: Timeout settings for multi-node startup and model execution on the slower A2 platform. Increase them if the engine fails to become ready in time.\n"
"- `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0`: Selects the V1 model runner for the A2 examples."
msgstr ""
"- `CPU_AFFINITY_CONF=1`：为工作进程启用 CPU 核心亲和性绑定。\n"
"- `ACL_OP_INIT_MODE=1`：ACL 算子初始化模式，用于加速算子编译。\n"
"- `VLLM_RPC_TIMEOUT=360000` / `VLLM_EXECUTE_MODEL_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=30000` / `HCCL_EXEC_TIMEOUT=200` / `HCCL_CONNECT_TIMEOUT=120` / `VLLM_ENGINE_READY_TIMEOUT_S=1200`：针对较慢的 A2 平台的多节点启动和模型执行的超时设置。如果引擎未能及时就绪，请增大这些值。\n"
"- `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0`：为 A2 示例选择 V1 模型运行器。"

msgid "**KV cache configuration:**"
msgstr "**KV cache 配置：**"

msgid ""
"- `--kv-cache-dtype turboquant_4bit_nc`: Enables 4-bit TurboQuant "
"quantization for the SFA packed main KV cache, as an alternative to `--kv-"
"cache-dtype int8`. It requires an A2/A3 device, cannot be combined with the "
"C8 cache, and in Prefill-Decode disaggregation the Mooncake option "
"`\"use_ascend_direct\"` must be `false`."
msgstr ""
"- `--kv-cache-dtype turboquant_4bit_nc`：为 SFA 打包的主 KV cache 启用 4-bit "
"TurboQuant 量化，作为 `--kv-cache-dtype int8` 的替代方案。它需要 A2/A3 设备，不能与 C8 cache "
"组合使用，并且在 Prefill-Decode 分离部署中，Mooncake 选项 `\"use_ascend_direct\"` 必须为 "
"`false`。"

msgid ""
"**A3-specific fused MC2 notice:**\n"
"This scenario enables `additional_config.enable_fused_mc2=1` (fused `dispatch_ffn_combine`/`mega_moe` operators). Fused MC2 conflicts with `multistream_overlap_shared_expert` — the two optimizations must not be enabled at the same time (the runtime forcibly disables `multistream_overlap_shared_expert` when fused MC2 is on).\n"
"The A2 four-node commands in this section do not enable fused MC2."
msgstr ""
"**A3 专属融合 MC2 注意事项：**\n"
"本场景启用 `additional_config.enable_fused_mc2=1`（融合 `dispatch_ffn_combine`/`mega_moe` 算子）。融合 MC2 与 `multistream_overlap_shared_expert` 冲突——这两个优化不能同时启用（当融合 MC2 开启时，运行时会强制禁用 `multistream_overlap_shared_expert`）。\n"
"本节中的 A2 四节点命令不启用融合 MC2。"

msgid ""
"Select the tab that matches the deployment hardware. The A3 reference uses\n"
"four nodes, while the A2 reference uses eight nodes."
msgstr ""
"选择与部署硬件匹配的标签页。A3 参考使用\n"
"四个节点，而 A2 参考使用八个节点。"

msgid "=== \"Atlas 800I A3 series\""
msgstr "=== \"Atlas 800I A3 series\""

msgid ""
"This A3 reference serves GLM-5.3 W8A8C8 with a **200,000-token** maximum\n"
"    sequence length for the 198K workload. It uses one Prefill engine spanning\n"
"    P0/P1 with TP16 and PP2, and sixteen TP2 Decode engines on D0/D1.\n"
"    Section 5.1.3 adds MemCache KV pooling to the same deployment."
msgstr ""
"此 A3 参考为 GLM-5.3 W8A8C8 提供服务，针对 198K 工作负载使用 **200,000 token** 的最大\n"
"    序列长度。它使用一个跨 P0/P1 的 Prefill 引擎，采用 TP16 和 PP2，并在 D0/D1 上使用十六个 TP2 Decode 引擎。\n"
"    第 5.1.3 节为同一部署添加了 MemCache KV 池化。"

msgid "**Topology and Prerequisites**"
msgstr "**拓扑与前提条件**"

msgid ""
"Each container exposes devices 0-15. P0 exposes the only Prefill API;\n"
"    P1 runs the second PP stage without an API server. Decode ranks 0-7 run\n"
"    on D0 and ranks 8-15 on D1, with API ports 8000-8007 on each node."
msgstr ""
"每个容器暴露设备 0-15。P0 暴露唯一的 Prefill API；\n"
"    P1 运行第二个 PP 阶段，不提供 API 服务器。Decode rank 0-7 运行\n"
"    在 D0 上，rank 8-15 运行在 D1 上，每个节点上的 API 端口为 8000-8007。"

msgid ""
"Use the A3 `{{ vllm_ascend_version }}-a3` image from Section 4.1 on all four"
" nodes."
msgstr "在所有四个节点上使用第 4.1 节中的 A3 `{{ vllm_ascend_version }}-a3` 镜像。"

msgid ""
"1. Prepare the same weights and software on all four nodes. Set `MODEL_PATH`\n"
"       and `PYTHON_LIB_DIR` in each role script to the installed paths. Install\n"
"       `fastokens` on Prefill nodes for `VLLM_USE_FASTOKENS=1`.\n"
"    2. Verify [multi-node communication](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-multi-node-interconnect).\n"
"       Set `LOCAL_IP=\"<PREFILL_NODE_IP>\"` on each Prefill node and\n"
"       `LOCAL_IP=\"<DECODE_NODE_IP>\"` on each Decode node to that node's IP.\n"
"       Set `NIC_NAME=\"<NETWORK_INTERFACE>\"` to its matching interface and\n"
"       `MODEL_PATH=\"<YOUR_MODEL_PATH>\"` to its model weight directory.\n"
"    3. Reserve the PP master port 7060, Decode DP RPC port 16600, API ports,\n"
"       proxy port 8000, and the topology-derived Mooncake transfer/handshake ports.\n"
"       Prefill and Decode run on separate node groups.\n"
"    4. Keep the 78-layer PP partition `42,36` consistent in the Prefill\n"
"       environment and both roles' connector topology. Both roles explicitly\n"
"       use int8 KV cache and int8 indexer KV cache for these W8A8C8 weights."
msgstr ""
"1. 在所有四个节点上准备相同的权重和软件。将每个角色脚本中的 `MODEL_PATH`\n"
"       和 `PYTHON_LIB_DIR` 设置为已安装的路径。在 Prefill 节点上安装\n"
"       `fastokens` 以使用 `VLLM_USE_FASTOKENS=1`。\n"
"    2. 验证[多节点通信](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-multi-node-interconnect)。\n"
"       在每个 Prefill 节点上将 `LOCAL_IP=\"<PREFILL_NODE_IP>\"` 设置为该节点的 IP，\n"
"       在每个 Decode 节点上将 `LOCAL_IP=\"<DECODE_NODE_IP>\"` 设置为该节点的 IP。\n"
"       将 `NIC_NAME=\"<NETWORK_INTERFACE>\"` 设置为其匹配的接口，\n"
"       将 `MODEL_PATH=\"<YOUR_MODEL_PATH>\"` 设置为其模型权重目录。\n"
"    3. 预留 PP 主端口 7060、Decode DP RPC 端口 16600、API 端口、\n"
"       代理端口 8000，以及根据拓扑推导出的 Mooncake 传输/握手端口。\n"
"       Prefill 和 Decode 运行在独立的节点组上。\n"
"    4. 在 Prefill 环境和两个角色的连接器拓扑中，保持 78 层 PP 分区 `42,36` 一致。\n"
"       对于这些 W8A8C8 权重，两个角色都显式\n"
"       使用 int8 KV cache 和 int8 indexer KV cache。"

msgid "<a id=\"glm53-pd-a3-scripts\"></a>"
msgstr "<a id=\"glm53-pd-a3-scripts\"></a>"

msgid "**Prepare the Scripts**"
msgstr "**准备脚本**"

msgid "<a id=\"glm53-pd-a3-start\"></a>"
msgstr "<a id=\"glm53-pd-a3-start\"></a>"

msgid "**Start the Engines**"
msgstr "**启动引擎**"

msgid "<a id=\"glm53-pd-a3-proxy\"></a>"
msgstr "<a id=\"glm53-pd-a3-proxy\"></a>"

msgid "**Start the Proxy**"
msgstr "**启动代理**"

msgid ""
"Replace each node's IP and installation-path placeholders before starting.\n"
"    Run the four commands in [Start the Engines](#glm53-pd-a3-start) in\n"
"    separate terminals. Keep the master processes running while the other\n"
"    nodes join; start both nodes of each group before waiting for the group\n"
"    to become healthy."
msgstr ""
"启动前，请替换各节点的 IP 和安装路径占位符。\n"
"    在[启动引擎](#glm53-pd-a3-start)中，将四条命令分别\n"
"    在不同的终端中运行。在其他节点加入时，保持主进程运行；\n"
"    在等待各组变为健康状态之前，先启动每组的两个节点。"

msgid ""
"After the Prefill API on P0:8000 and all sixteen Decode APIs respond\n"
"    to `GET /v1/models`, start the\n"
"    [PD load-balancing proxy](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py)\n"
"    from the matching checkout on a separate host that can reach all P/D\n"
"    API endpoints. The proxy listens on port 8000; using a separate host\n"
"    avoids a port conflict with P0:8000 and the Decode APIs on 8000-8007.\n"
"    Register P0 once and all sixteen Decode endpoints. P1 is not a separate\n"
"    Prefill API endpoint."
msgstr ""
"当 P0:8000 上的 Prefill API 以及全部十六个 Decode API 均能响应\n"
"    `GET /v1/models` 后，在能够访问所有 P/D API 端点的独立主机上，\n"
"    从对应的代码检出目录启动\n"
"    [PD 负载均衡代理](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py)。\n"
"    该代理监听端口 8000；使用独立主机可避免与 P0:8000 以及\n"
"    8000-8007 上的 Decode API 发生端口冲突。\n"
"    注册一次 P0 以及全部十六个 Decode 端点。P1 不是独立的\n"
"    Prefill API 端点。"

msgid ""
"- Prefill uses TP16/PP2 over two nodes with the `mp` executor and\n"
"      `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=\"42,36\"`. Its batch budget is 16,384 tokens,\n"
"      maximum sequence count is 64, and it runs in eager mode with one MTP token.\n"
"    - Decode uses DP16/TP2, a 256-token batch budget, 64 sequences, five MTP\n"
"      tokens with an eager draft model, and `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph mode.\n"
"      `recompute_scheduler_enable=true` allows recomputation scheduling.\n"
"    - Both roles retain chunked prefill, prefix caching, async scheduling,\n"
"      seed 1024, memory utilization 0.92, and fused MC2. Prefill also enables\n"
"      DSA CP and FlashComm1. Both use `glm47` tool and reasoning parsers and\n"
"      the served model name `glm5`.\n"
"    - `MooncakeConnectorV2` declares the same Prefill DP1/PP2/TP16 and\n"
"      Decode DP16/TP2 topology on both sides. The non-pooled base KV ports\n"
"      are 30000 on Prefill and 30100 on Decode; reserve derived worker ports.\n"
"    - The examples give Prefill and each Decode engine distinct `engine_id`\n"
"      values so P-to-D peer registration cannot conflict."
msgstr ""
"- Prefill 使用 TP16/PP2，跨两个节点，采用 `mp` executor 和\n"
"      `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=\"42,36\"`。其批处理预算为 16,384 个 token，\n"
"      最大序列数为 64，并以 eager 模式运行，使用一个 MTP token。\n"
"    - Decode 使用 DP16/TP2，批处理预算为 256 个 token，64 个序列，五个 MTP\n"
"      token，采用 eager draft 模型，以及 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图模式。\n"
"      `recompute_scheduler_enable=true` 允许重计算调度。\n"
"    - 两种角色均保留 chunked prefill、prefix caching、异步调度、\n"
"      seed 1024、内存利用率 0.92 以及 fused MC2。Prefill 还启用了\n"
"      DSA CP 和 FlashComm1。两者均使用 `glm47` 工具和推理解析器，\n"
"      以及服务模型名称 `glm5`。\n"
"    - `MooncakeConnectorV2` 在两端声明相同的 Prefill DP1/PP2/TP16 和\n"
"      Decode DP16/TP2 拓扑。非池化的基础 KV 端口\n"
"      在 Prefill 上为 30000，在 Decode 上为 30100；请预留派生出的 worker 端口。\n"
"    - 示例为 Prefill 和每个 Decode 引擎分配了不同的 `engine_id`\n"
"      值，以避免 P 到 D 的对等注册发生冲突。"

msgid "=== \"Atlas 800I A2 series\""
msgstr "=== \"Atlas 800I A2 series\""

msgid "<a id=\"glm53-pd-a2\"></a>"
msgstr "<a id=\"glm53-pd-a2\"></a>"

msgid "**Eight-Node Deployment**"
msgstr "**八节点部署**"

msgid ""
"This reference deploys GLM-5.3 W8A8C8 on eight Atlas 800I A2 (64GB × 8)\n"
"    nodes. The rc1 reference uses `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:v0.30.0rc1`\n"
"    with the A2 container command from Section 4.1. Both roles enable expert\n"
"    parallelism to distribute the MoE expert weights across their DP × TP ranks."
msgstr ""
"本参考在八个 Atlas 800I A2（64GB × 8）节点上部署 GLM-5.3 W8A8C8。\n"
"    rc1 参考使用 `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:v0.30.0rc1`，\n"
"    并采用第 4.1 节中的 A2 容器命令。两种角色均启用专家\n"
"    并行，以将 MoE 专家权重分布到各自的 DP × TP rank 上。"

msgid ""
"P0 exposes the only Prefill API on port 8077; P1-P3 are headless.\n"
"    Decode exposes ports 10010-10013 on each node. Prefill uses the `mp`\n"
"    executor with `--nnodes 4`; Decode uses a launcher to start one TP2\n"
"    engine per DP rank. Both roles pin the V1 model runner and use int8\n"
"    attention and indexer KV caches. This deployment has no pipeline\n"
"    parallelism; the [A2 pooling topology in Section 5.1.3](#glm53-pool-a2) is different."
msgstr ""
"P0 在端口 8077 上暴露唯一的 Prefill API；P1-P3 为无头节点。\n"
"    Decode 在每个节点上暴露端口 10010-10013。Prefill 使用 `mp`\n"
"    executor 和 `--nnodes 4`；Decode 使用启动器为每个 DP rank 启动一个 TP2\n"
"    引擎。两种角色均固定使用 V1 模型运行器，并使用 int8\n"
"    注意力和 indexer KV 缓存。此部署没有流水线\n"
"    并行；[第 5.1.3 节中的 A2 池化拓扑](#glm53-pool-a2) 有所不同。"

msgid ""
"Prepare identical weights and software on all eight nodes, verify\n"
"    [multi-node communication](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-multi-node-interconnect),\n"
"    and set the model path, node IP, and network interface in each script.\n"
"    Install `fastokens` on every Prefill node for `VLLM_USE_FASTOKENS=1`.\n"
"    Reserve Prefill master port 29501, Prefill DP RPC port 12980, Decode\n"
"    DP RPC port 12990, the API and proxy ports, and Mooncake ports derived\n"
"    from base ports 30000 on Prefill and 30100 on Decode."
msgstr ""
"在所有八个节点上准备相同的权重和软件，验证\n"
"    [多节点通信](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-multi-node-interconnect)，\n"
"    并在每个脚本中设置模型路径、节点 IP 和网络接口。\n"
"    在每个 Prefill 节点上安装 `fastokens` 以使用 `VLLM_USE_FASTOKENS=1`。\n"
"    预留 Prefill 主端口 29501、Prefill DP RPC 端口 12980、Decode\n"
"    DP RPC 端口 12990、API 和代理端口，以及从 Prefill 基础端口 30000\n"
"    和 Decode 基础端口 30100 派生出的 Mooncake 端口。"

msgid "<a id=\"glm53-pd-a2-launcher\"></a>"
msgstr "<a id=\"glm53-pd-a2-launcher\"></a>"

msgid "**Prepare the Decode DP Launcher**"
msgstr "**准备 Decode DP 启动器**"

msgid ""
"Save the following A2 launcher as `launch_online_dp.py` on all Decode\n"
"    nodes. It allocates disjoint local device lists within the eight devices\n"
"    exposed by each A2 container. Arguments `$1`-`$7` passed to the engine\n"
"    script are visible devices, API port, global DP size, DP rank, DP master\n"
"    IP, DP RPC port, and TP size. Prefill is started directly with `vllm serve`."
msgstr ""
"将以下 A2 启动器保存为所有 Decode 节点上的 `launch_online_dp.py`。\n"
"    它在每个 A2 容器暴露的八个设备中分配互不相交的本地设备列表。\n"
"    传递给引擎脚本的参数 `$1`-`$7` 分别是可见设备、API 端口、全局 DP 大小、\n"
"    DP rank、DP 主节点 IP、DP RPC 端口和 TP 大小。Prefill 直接使用 `vllm serve` 启动。"

msgid "**Prefill Engine Script**"
msgstr "**Prefill 引擎脚本**"

msgid ""
"Save this script as `start_p_engine.sh` on P0-P3. Set `P_MASTER_IP` to\n"
"    P0's IP in every copy and `NIC_NAME` to the current node's interface.\n"
"    The command-line arguments select the node rank, API port, local IP,\n"
"    and visible devices."
msgstr ""
"将此脚本保存为 P0-P3 上的 `start_p_engine.sh`。在每个副本中将 `P_MASTER_IP`\n"
"    设置为 P0 的 IP，并将 `NIC_NAME` 设置为当前节点的网络接口。\n"
"    命令行参数用于选择节点 rank、API 端口、本地 IP\n"
"    和可见设备。"

msgid ""
"For v0.30.0rc1, apply the single-local-DP-rank compatibility fix in\n"
"    [v0.30.0rc1 Compatibility and Troubleshooting](#glm53-a2-rc1-compatibility)\n"
"    to the active vLLM-Ascend installation on every Prefill node before\n"
"    starting the group."
msgstr ""
"对于 v0.30.0rc1，在启动该组之前，请将\n"
"    [v0.30.0rc1 兼容性与故障排除](#glm53-a2-rc1-compatibility) 中的单本地 DP rank 兼容性修复\n"
"    应用到每个 Prefill 节点上正在使用的 vLLM-Ascend 安装。"

msgid "**Decode Engine Script**"
msgstr "**Decode 引擎脚本**"

msgid ""
"Save this script as `start_d_engine.sh` on D0-D3. Configure the current\n"
"    node's `LOCAL_IP`, `NIC_NAME`, and `MODEL_PATH` in each copy. The launcher\n"
"    supplies `$1`-`$7`, including the device list for each TP2 engine."
msgstr ""
"将此脚本保存为 D0-D3 上的 `start_d_engine.sh`。在每个副本中配置当前\n"
"    节点的 `LOCAL_IP`、`NIC_NAME` 和 `MODEL_PATH`。启动器\n"
"    提供 `$1`-`$7`，包括每个 TP2 引擎的设备列表。"

msgid ""
"Both sides declare the same topology and use `MooncakeConnectorV2` for\n"
"    this non-uniform DP × TP layout. Prefill and Decode use different\n"
"    `engine_id` values; each independently launched Decode engine includes\n"
"    its global DP rank in its ID."
msgstr ""
"两端声明相同的拓扑，并针对这种非均匀的 DP × TP 布局使用 `MooncakeConnectorV2`。\n"
"    Prefill 和 Decode 使用不同的\n"
"    `engine_id` 值；每个独立启动的 Decode 引擎在其 ID 中包含\n"
"    其全局 DP rank。"

msgid ""
"Run the Decode commands on their respective nodes in separate terminals.\n"
"    Start all four nodes before waiting for the DP group to become ready."
msgstr ""
"在各自节点上的不同终端中运行 Decode 命令。\n"
"    在等待 DP 组变为就绪状态之前，先启动全部四个节点。"

msgid ""
"Start Prefill on P0, then P2, P1, and P3. Run each command on its target\n"
"    node, keeping the master process running while the other nodes join."
msgstr ""
"在 P0 上启动 Prefill，然后依次启动 P2、P1 和 P3。在目标节点上运行每条命令，\n"
"    并在其他节点加入时保持主进程运行。"

msgid ""
"Wait for P0:8077 and all sixteen Decode APIs on ports 10010-10013 to\n"
"    answer `GET /v1/models`. Confirm in the logs that P1-P3 have joined;\n"
"    headless nodes do not expose HTTP APIs. When HTTP proxy variables are\n"
"    set, use `curl --noproxy '*'` for business-IP checks to avoid proxy\n"
"    interception and HTTP 403 responses. For example, check P0 as follows,\n"
"    then check each Decode endpoint in the same way:"
msgstr ""
"等待 P0:8077 以及端口 10010-10013 上的全部十六个 Decode API 响应\n"
"    `GET /v1/models`。在日志中确认 P1-P3 已加入；\n"
"    headless 节点不暴露 HTTP API。当设置了 HTTP 代理变量时，\n"
"    对业务 IP 检查使用 `curl --noproxy '*'`，以避免代理\n"
"    拦截和 HTTP 403 响应。例如，按如下方式检查 P0，\n"
"    然后以相同方式检查每个 Decode 端点："

msgid ""
"Start the load-balancing proxy on P0 or a host that can reach all\n"
"    endpoints. Clear inherited proxy settings before starting it:"
msgstr ""
"在 P0 或能够访问所有端点的主机上启动负载均衡代理。\n"
"    启动前清除继承的代理设置："

msgid ""
"Check the proxy and send requests with model name `glm5`, explicitly\n"
"    bypassing any client-side HTTP proxy:"
msgstr ""
"检查代理并使用模型名称 `glm5` 发送请求，显式\n"
"    绕过任何客户端 HTTP 代理："

msgid ""
"Both roles use a 135,000-token maximum length, memory utilization 0.92,\n"
"    and three MTP tokens. Prefill uses eager mode, an 8192-token batch budget,\n"
"    64 sequences, DSA CP, and FlashComm1. Decode uses a 256-token\n"
"    batch budget, 32 sequences, `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graphs, sparse C8 options,\n"
"    and recomputation scheduling."
msgstr ""
"两种角色均使用 135,000 token 的最大长度、0.92 的显存利用率\n"
"    以及三个 MTP token。Prefill 使用 eager 模式、8192 token 的批处理预算、\n"
"    64 个序列、DSA CP 和 FlashComm1。Decode 使用 256 token 的\n"
"    批处理预算、32 个序列、`FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图、稀疏 C8 选项\n"
"    以及重计算调度。"

msgid "<a id=\"glm53-a2-rc1-compatibility\"></a>"
msgstr "<a id=\"glm53-a2-rc1-compatibility\"></a>"

msgid "**v0.30.0rc1 Compatibility and Troubleshooting**"
msgstr "**v0.30.0rc1 兼容性与故障排查**"

msgid ""
"If Prefill fails during Mooncake KV cache registration with\n"
"    `ValueError: Mooncake worker requires a local DP rank`, first verify that\n"
"    `--data-parallel-size-local 1` is present in `start_p_engine.sh`.\n"
"    P0/P1 form global DP rank 0 and P2/P3 form global DP rank 1; each node\n"
"    has one local DP rank. Even with that option, v0.30.0rc1 multi-node TP\n"
"    headless workers may receive `data_parallel_rank_local=None`."
msgstr ""
"如果 Prefill 在 Mooncake KV 缓存注册期间失败并报错\n"
"    `ValueError: Mooncake worker requires a local DP rank`，首先确认\n"
"    `start_p_engine.sh` 中存在 `--data-parallel-size-local 1`。\n"
"    P0/P1 构成全局 DP rank 0，P2/P3 构成全局 DP rank 1；每个节点\n"
"    有一个本地 DP rank。即使设置了该选项，v0.30.0rc1 多节点 TP\n"
"    headless worker 仍可能收到 `data_parallel_rank_local=None`。"

msgid ""
"For the rc1 image, apply the following change to\n"
"    `vllm_ascend/distributed/kv_transfer/kv_p2p/mooncake/base_worker.py`\n"
"    in the vLLM-Ascend installation used by **every Prefill node** before\n"
"    launching the scripts. It infers local rank 0 only when\n"
"    `data_parallel_size_local == 1`; multiple-local-rank configurations\n"
"    still require an explicit local rank."
msgstr ""
"对于 rc1 镜像，在启动脚本之前，对**每个 Prefill 节点**所使用的\n"
"    vLLM-Ascend 安装中的\n"
"    `vllm_ascend/distributed/kv_transfer/kv_p2p/mooncake/base_worker.py`\n"
"    应用以下修改。它仅在\n"
"    `data_parallel_size_local == 1` 时推断本地 rank 为 0；多本地 rank 配置\n"
"    仍需要显式的本地 rank。"

msgid ""
"The same rc1 compatibility fix is required by the pooled Prefill PP\n"
"    headless workers in the [A2 pooling tab of Section 5.1.3](#glm53-pool-a2).\n"
"    Confirm that the active Python package contains the change on every\n"
"    Prefill node, then start all members of the Prefill group before waiting\n"
"    for it to become ready."
msgstr ""
"[5.1.3 节的 A2 池化标签页](#glm53-pool-a2)中的池化 Prefill PP\n"
"    headless worker 也需要相同的 rc1 兼容性修复。\n"
"    确认每个 Prefill 节点上正在使用的 Python 包包含该修改，然后启动\n"
"    Prefill 组的所有成员，再等待其就绪。"

msgid ""
"The supplied A2 deployment validation record dated 2026-10-15 reports\n"
"    the following results with the explicit local-DP setting and rc1 fix:"
msgstr ""
"所提供的日期为 2026-10-15 的 A2 部署验证记录报告了\n"
"    在使用显式 local-DP 设置和 rc1 修复后的以下结果："

msgid "| Check | Recorded result |"
msgstr "| 检查项 | 记录结果 |"

msgid "    | Smoke request | HTTP 200; answer `84` |"
msgstr "    | 冒烟请求 | HTTP 200；答案为 `84` |"

msgid "    | Elapsed time for the 200-request run | 105.324 seconds |"
msgstr "    | 200 次请求运行的耗时 | 105.324 秒 |"

msgid ""
"The request counts report successful completion, not an accuracy score."
msgstr "请求计数报告的是成功完成情况，而非准确率得分。"

msgid ""
"Select the tab that matches the deployment hardware and its Prefill "
"topology."
msgstr "选择与部署硬件及其 Prefill 拓扑相匹配的标签页。"

msgid ""
"This extends the same four-node PP/PD topology with `MultiConnector`:\n"
"    `MooncakeConnectorV2` transfers KV cache from Prefill to Decode, and\n"
"    `AscendStoreConnector` provides non-layerwise MemCache pooling. Retain\n"
"    the launcher, PP placement, and proxy routing from the A3 tab of Section 5.1.2."
msgstr ""
"这通过 `MultiConnector` 扩展了相同的四节点 PP/PD 拓扑：\n"
"    `MooncakeConnectorV2` 将 KV 缓存从 Prefill 传输到 Decode，\n"
"    `AscendStoreConnector` 提供非逐层 MemCache 池化。保留\n"
"    5.1.2 节 A3 标签页中的启动器、PP 布局和代理路由。"

msgid "**Prepare MemCache**"
msgstr "**准备 MemCache**"

msgid ""
"Complete [MemCache backend setup](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-backend),\n"
"    including the hardware/CANN prerequisites, `memfabric-hybrid` and\n"
"    `memcache-hybrid` installation, configuration files, and metadata service.\n"
"    All P/D instances must access the same pool; connector arguments do not\n"
"    start the MemCache service. Set `MEMCACHE_ROOT` to the installed\n"
"    `memcache_hybrid` directory and `PYTHON_LIB_DIR` to the library directory\n"
"    of the Python installation actually used by vLLM on each node."
msgstr ""
"完成 [MemCache 后端设置](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-backend)，\n"
"    包括硬件/CANN 前提条件、`memfabric-hybrid` 和\n"
"    `memcache-hybrid` 安装、配置文件以及元数据服务。\n"
"    所有 P/D 实例必须访问同一个池；连接器参数不会\n"
"    启动 MemCache 服务。将 `MEMCACHE_ROOT` 设置为已安装的\n"
"    `memcache_hybrid` 目录，将 `PYTHON_LIB_DIR` 设置为每个节点上\n"
"    vLLM 实际使用的 Python 安装的库目录。"

msgid ""
"1. prepare the script `launch_online_dp.py` on each Decode node, using the\n"
"       launcher in [Prepare the Scripts](#glm53-pd-a3-scripts)."
msgstr ""
"1. 在每个 Decode 节点上准备脚本 `launch_online_dp.py`，使用\n"
"       [准备脚本](#glm53-pd-a3-scripts)中的启动器。"

msgid ""
"The pooled configuration uses base KV ports 30000 on Prefill and\n"
"    30200 on Decode. The outer `engine_id` is unique per engine and is\n"
"    inherited by the child connectors. This differs from the supplied pooled\n"
"    reference's repeated `\"0\"` IDs to avoid Mooncake peer identity conflicts.\n"
"    `lookup_rpc_port=\"0\"` is retained: Ascend Store uses an IPC endpoint that\n"
"    also includes the DP rank, and P/D run on separate hosts. It is not a TCP\n"
"    listener on port zero. `backend=\"memcache\"` and `use_layerwise=false`\n"
"    are set on both sides."
msgstr ""
"池化配置在 Prefill 上使用基础 KV 端口 30000，在 Decode 上\n"
"    使用 30200。外层 `engine_id` 对每个引擎唯一，并\n"
"    由子连接器继承。这与所提供的池化\n"
"    参考中重复的 `\"0\"` ID 不同，以避免 Mooncake 对等身份冲突。\n"
"    保留 `lookup_rpc_port=\"0\"`：Ascend Store 使用的 IPC 端点\n"
"    也包含 DP rank，且 P/D 运行在不同主机上。它不是端口零上的 TCP\n"
"    监听器。两侧均设置了 `backend=\"memcache\"` 和 `use_layerwise=false`。"

msgid "<a id=\"glm53-pool-a3-start\"></a>"
msgstr "<a id=\"glm53-pool-a3-start\"></a>"

msgid ""
"Start the MemCache metadata service and complete its configuration on all\n"
"    four nodes before starting vLLM."
msgstr ""
"在启动 vLLM 之前，在所有四个节点上启动 MemCache 元数据服务\n"
"    并完成其配置。"

msgid "**Start the Proxy and Verify Pooling**"
msgstr "**启动代理并验证池化**"

msgid ""
"1. Start the MemCache metadata service and complete its configuration on\n"
"       all four nodes before starting vLLM.\n"
"    2. Start P0, P1, D0, and D1 with the commands in\n"
"       [Start the Engines](#glm53-pool-a3-start). Both Prefill scripts\n"
"       already specify port 8000.\n"
"    3. Wait for P0:8000 and all sixteen Decode APIs to become healthy. Start\n"
"       the [A3 PD proxy](#glm53-pd-a3-proxy) on a separate host, using the same\n"
"       Prefill endpoint and Decode ports 8000-8007. Its public port is 8000.\n"
"    4. Send requests to the proxy using the served model name `glm5`:"
msgstr ""
"1. 在启动 vLLM 之前，在所有四个节点上启动 MemCache 元数据服务\n"
"       并完成其配置。\n"
"    2. 使用[启动引擎](#glm53-pool-a3-start)中的命令\n"
"       启动 P0、P1、D0 和 D1。两个 Prefill 脚本\n"
"       均已指定端口 8000。\n"
"    3. 等待 P0:8000 和全部十六个 Decode API 变为健康状态。在单独的主机上\n"
"       启动 [A3 PD 代理](#glm53-pd-a3-proxy)，使用相同的\n"
"       Prefill 端点和 Decode 端口 8000-8007。其公共端口为 8000。\n"
"    4. 使用所服务的模型名称 `glm5` 向代理发送请求："

msgid ""
"For either mode, check P/D logs for successful KV transfer. For pooling,\n"
"    also check MemCache initialization, then warm the pool with a prompt longer\n"
"    than one cache block and repeat requests with the same prefix. Inspect\n"
"    Ascend Store/MemCache saves, lookups, loads, and hit metrics. A successful\n"
"    response or a local prefix-cache hit alone does not demonstrate shared pool\n"
"    reuse; verify a pool load when the prefix is absent from the engine's local\n"
"    cache. These A3 references do not\n"
"    establish A2, 1M-context, or other parallel-layout support, and do not add\n"
"    accuracy or performance claims for the 198K workload."
msgstr ""
"对于任一模式，请检查 P/D 日志以确认 KV 传输成功。对于池化模式，\n"
"    还需检查 MemCache 初始化，然后用一个长于单个缓存块的提示词预热池，\n"
"    并使用相同前缀重复请求。检查 Ascend Store/MemCache 的保存、查找、\n"
"    加载和命中指标。仅凭一次成功的响应或本地前缀缓存命中，并不能证明\n"
"    共享池复用；当引擎本地缓存中不存在该前缀时，请验证池加载。这些 A3\n"
"    参考配置并不\n"
"    代表支持 A2、1M 上下文或其他并行布局，也不为 198K 工作负载增加\n"
"    精度或性能方面的声明。"

msgid "<a id=\"glm53-pool-a2\"></a>"
msgstr "<a id=\"glm53-pool-a2\"></a>"

msgid "**Eight-Node Deployment with MemCache KV Cache Pool**"
msgstr "**使用 MemCache KV 缓存池的八节点部署**"

msgid ""
"This A2 pooling reference uses four Prefill nodes and four Decode nodes,\n"
"    with eight devices per node. Two independent Prefill instances each\n"
"    span two nodes with TP8 × PP2. Each instance has DP size 1 and its own\n"
"    API server; the proxy registers both instance leaders. Decode uses one\n"
"    DP16 × TP2 group across four nodes."
msgstr ""
"此 A2 池化参考配置使用四个 Prefill 节点和四个 Decode 节点，\n"
"    每个节点八个设备。两个独立的 Prefill 实例各自\n"
"    跨两个节点，采用 TP8 × PP2。每个实例的 DP 大小为 1，并拥有自己的\n"
"    API 服务器；代理会注册两个实例的 leader。Decode 使用一个\n"
"    跨四个节点的 DP16 × TP2 组。"

msgid "| Role | Nodes | Parallelism | Placement | Devices per role |"
msgstr "| 角色 | 节点 | 并行度 | 部署位置 | 每个角色的设备数 |"

msgid ""
"P0 and P2 expose APIs on port 8000; P1 and P3 are headless PP partners.\n"
"    Decode exposes ports 8000-8003 on each node, and the proxy listens on\n"
"    1999. This PP2 layout is separate from the non-pooled DP2 × TP16\n"
"    Prefill layout in the [A2 PD tab of Section 5.1.2](#glm53-pd-a2).\n"
"    Use the A2 image from Section 4.1 and the\n"
"    [A2 Decode launcher](#glm53-pd-a2-launcher)."
msgstr ""
"P0 和 P2 在端口 8000 上暴露 API；P1 和 P3 是无头的 PP 伙伴。\n"
"    Decode 在每个节点上暴露端口 8000-8003，代理监听\n"
"    1999。此 PP2 布局与 [5.1.2 节的 A2 PD 标签页](#glm53-pd-a2)中\n"
"    非池化的 DP2 × TP16 Prefill 布局不同。\n"
"    使用 4.1 节中的 A2 镜像以及\n"
"    [A2 Decode 启动器](#glm53-pd-a2-launcher)。"

msgid ""
"The pooled Prefill and Decode engines both use `--max-model-len 128000`,\n"
"    with MTP token counts 1 and 5, respectively.\n"
"    The end-to-end limit is **128,000 tokens**, including input and output.\n"
"    Both roles declare the actual Prefill DP1/PP2/TP8 partition `42,36` and\n"
"    Decode DP16/TP2 topology."
msgstr ""
"池化的 Prefill 和 Decode 引擎均使用 `--max-model-len 128000`，\n"
"    MTP token 数分别为 1 和 5。\n"
"    端到端上限为 **128,000 tokens**，包括输入和输出。\n"
"    两个角色都声明了实际的 Prefill DP1/PP2/TP8 分区 `42,36` 以及\n"
"    Decode DP16/TP2 拓扑。"

msgid "<a id=\"glm53-pool-a2-prepare\"></a>"
msgstr "<a id=\"glm53-pool-a2-prepare\"></a>"

msgid ""
"Complete [MemCache backend setup](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-backend)\n"
"    on every node, including the hardware/CANN prerequisites and installation\n"
"    of `memfabric-hybrid` and `memcache-hybrid`. Install `fastokens` on all\n"
"    four Prefill nodes. All eight nodes must reach the same MetaService."
msgstr ""
"在每个节点上完成 [MemCache 后端设置](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-backend)，\n"
"    包括硬件/CANN 前置条件以及安装\n"
"    `memfabric-hybrid` 和 `memcache-hybrid`。在所有\n"
"    四个 Prefill 节点上安装 `fastokens`。所有八个节点必须能访问同一个 MetaService。"

msgid ""
"On every Prefill and Decode **host**, configure hugepages before\n"
"    starting MemCache services:"
msgstr ""
"在每个 Prefill 和 Decode **主机**上，在启动 MemCache 服务之前\n"
"    配置大页："

msgid "The check must print:"
msgstr "该检查必须输出："

msgid ""
"This is a host prerequisite for the `device_rdma` configuration with\n"
"    `40GB` DRAM per LocalService; check all eight hosts before proceeding."
msgstr ""
"这是 `device_rdma` 配置（每个 LocalService 使用 `40GB` DRAM）的\n"
"    主机前置条件；在继续之前请检查所有八个主机。"

msgid "Prepare `mmc-meta.conf` for the MetaService on `<MEMCACHE_META_IP>`:"
msgstr "为 `<MEMCACHE_META_IP>` 上的 MetaService 准备 `mmc-meta.conf`："

msgid ""
"Prepare `mmc-local.conf` in shared storage, or an identical copy on every\n"
"    node. Use the A2/RoCE protocol and allocate `40GB` of pooled DRAM per\n"
"    LocalService:"
msgstr ""
"在共享存储中准备 `mmc-local.conf`，或在每个节点上准备一份完全相同的\n"
"    副本。使用 A2/RoCE 协议，并为每个\n"
"    LocalService 分配 `40GB` 的池化 DRAM："

msgid ""
"`world_size=256` is the maximum number of LocalServices supported, with\n"
"    headroom; it is not the number of NPUs in this deployment. `dram.size`\n"
"    is allocated per LocalService: eight LocalServices contribute `320GB`\n"
"    per fully populated A2 node. MetaService ports 5000/6000, metrics port\n"
"    8009, Prefill master port 7060 on each instance leader, Decode DP RPC\n"
"    port 12990, API/proxy ports, and the Mooncake ports derived from base\n"
"    ports 30000/30200 must be reachable as appropriate."
msgstr ""
"`world_size=256` 是支持的最大 LocalService 数量，并留有余量；\n"
"    它不是此部署中的 NPU 数量。`dram.size`\n"
"    按每个 LocalService 分配：八个 LocalService 为每个满载的 A2 节点\n"
"    贡献 `320GB`。MetaService 端口 5000/6000、指标端口\n"
"    8009、每个实例 leader 上的 Prefill master 端口 7060、Decode DP RPC\n"
"    端口 12990、API/代理端口，以及由基础端口 30000/30200 派生的\n"
"    Mooncake 端口，都必须按需可达。"

msgid ""
"On **each** Prefill and Decode node, export the following settings using\n"
"    that node's installed paths and interface:"
msgstr ""
"在**每个** Prefill 和 Decode 节点上，使用该节点已安装的路径和接口\n"
"    导出以下设置："

msgid ""
"The scripts use `MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH` to locate the same local\n"
"    configuration. On the MetaService host, set `MEMCACHE_ROOT` to its\n"
"    installation directory and place `mmc-meta.conf` under its `config`\n"
"    directory, or set `MMC_META_CONFIG_PATH` to the actual file path."
msgstr ""
"这些脚本使用 `MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH` 来定位相同的本地\n"
"    配置。在 MetaService 主机上，将 `MEMCACHE_ROOT` 设置为其\n"
"    安装目录，并将 `mmc-meta.conf` 放在其 `config`\n"
"    目录下，或将 `MMC_META_CONFIG_PATH` 设置为实际文件路径。"

msgid "**Prefill Engine Script (Pooled)**"
msgstr "**Prefill 引擎脚本（池化）**"

msgid ""
"Save this script as `start_p_pool.sh` on P0-P3. The arguments select the\n"
"    PP node rank, API port, local IP, instance leader IP, instance ID, and\n"
"    visible devices. Both PP stages of one instance use the same master\n"
"    address, partition, and engine ID. The two independent instances have\n"
"    different master addresses and engine IDs."
msgstr ""
"将此脚本保存为 P0-P3 上的 `start_p_pool.sh`。参数用于选择\n"
"    PP 节点 rank、API 端口、本地 IP、实例 leader IP、实例 ID 以及\n"
"    可见设备。一个实例的两个 PP 阶段使用相同的 master\n"
"    地址、分区和引擎 ID。两个独立实例具有\n"
"    不同的 master 地址和引擎 ID。"

msgid ""
"The Prefill script keeps `--no-async-scheduling` together with the V1\n"
"    runner and `profiling_chunk_config.enabled=true`. Enabling async\n"
"    scheduling with this combination is rejected by the runtime."
msgstr ""
"Prefill 脚本将 `--no-async-scheduling` 与 V1\n"
"    runner 以及 `profiling_chunk_config.enabled=true` 一起保留。在此组合下启用异步\n"
"    调度会被运行时拒绝。"

msgid ""
"On v0.30.0rc1, PP headless workers may fail with\n"
"    `Mooncake worker requires a local DP rank`. Each pooled Prefill instance\n"
"    has DP size 1, so apply the single-local-DP-rank compatibility fix in\n"
"    [v0.30.0rc1 Compatibility and Troubleshooting](#glm53-a2-rc1-compatibility)\n"
"    to all Prefill nodes before starting the two instances."
msgstr ""
"在 v0.30.0rc1 上，PP 无头 worker 可能会失败并报错\n"
"    `Mooncake worker requires a local DP rank`。每个池化的 Prefill 实例\n"
"    的 DP 大小为 1，因此在启动这两个实例之前，请对\n"
"    所有 Prefill 节点应用 [v0.30.0rc1 兼容性与故障排查](#glm53-a2-rc1-compatibility)\n"
"    中的单本地 DP rank 兼容性修复。"

msgid "**Decode Engine Script (Pooled)**"
msgstr "**Decode 引擎脚本（池化）**"

msgid ""
"Save this script as `start_d_engine_pool.sh` on D0-D3. Configure the\n"
"    current node's `LOCAL_IP` in each copy and export the paths and NIC\n"
"    settings from [Prepare MemCache](#glm53-pool-a2-prepare).\n"
"    The A2 launcher supplies `$1`-`$7`."
msgstr ""
"将此脚本保存为 D0-D3 上的 `start_d_engine_pool.sh`。在每个副本中\n"
"    配置当前节点的 `LOCAL_IP`，并导出 [准备 MemCache](#glm53-pool-a2-prepare)\n"
"    中的路径和 NIC 设置。\n"
"    A2 启动器会提供 `$1`-`$7`。"

msgid ""
"Both scripts use `MultiConnector` with `MooncakeConnectorV2` for KV\n"
"    transfer and `AscendStoreConnector` for non-layerwise MemCache pooling.\n"
"    Distinct instance/rank-based engine IDs avoid P-to-D peer identity\n"
"    conflicts. The outer ID is inherited by the child connectors.\n"
"    `lookup_rpc_port=\"0\"` identifies an IPC endpoint that also includes the\n"
"    DP rank; it is not a TCP listener on port zero."
msgstr ""
"两个脚本都使用 `MultiConnector`，其中 `MooncakeConnectorV2` 用于 KV\n"
"    传输，`AscendStoreConnector` 用于非分层 MemCache 池化。\n"
"    基于实例/rank 的不同引擎 ID 可避免 P 到 D 的对等身份\n"
"    冲突。外层 ID 由子连接器继承。\n"
"    `lookup_rpc_port=\"0\"` 标识一个 IPC 端点，该端点还包含\n"
"    DP rank；它不是监听端口零的 TCP 监听器。"

msgid "**Start Services**"
msgstr "**启动服务**"

msgid ""
"1. Start the MetaService on `<MEMCACHE_META_IP>` before any vLLM process:"
msgstr "1. 在任何 vLLM 进程之前，先在 `<MEMCACHE_META_IP>` 上启动 MetaService："

msgid ""
"2. Export the settings from [Prepare MemCache](#glm53-pool-a2-prepare)\n"
"       on **every** Prefill node. Start both PP stages of each instance in\n"
"       separate terminals before waiting for the instance to become ready:"
msgstr ""
"2. 在**每个** Prefill 节点上导出 [Prepare MemCache](#glm53-pool-a2-prepare) "
"中的设置。在等待实例就绪之前，请在单独的终端中启动每个实例的两个 PP 阶段："

msgid ""
"3. Export the settings from [Prepare MemCache](#glm53-pool-a2-prepare)\n"
"       on every Decode node and start all four nodes before waiting for the\n"
"       DP group to become ready:"
msgstr ""
"3. 在每个 Decode 节点上导出 [Prepare MemCache](#glm53-pool-a2-prepare) 中的设置，并在等待 DP "
"组就绪之前启动全部四个节点："

msgid ""
"4. Confirm that the Decode worker logs report completion of the MemCache\n"
"       DP initialization barrier before treating the group as ready:"
msgstr "4. 在将该组视为就绪之前，请确认 Decode worker 日志报告 MemCache DP 初始化屏障已完成："

msgid ""
"The Prefill instances have DP size 1 and do not enter this DP\n"
"        barrier; check their logs for successful MemCache initialization and\n"
"        verify that P1 and P3 joined their PP instances. They do not expose\n"
"        HTTP APIs. On every node, confirm that the active `mmc-local.conf`\n"
"        uses `device_rdma` and `dram.size = 40GB`."
msgstr ""
"Prefill 实例的 DP size 为 1，不会进入此 DP 屏障；请检查其日志以确认 MemCache 初始化成功，并验证 P1 和 P3 "
"已加入各自的 PP 实例。它们不暴露 HTTP API。在每个节点上，确认当前生效的 `mmc-local.conf` 使用 `device_rdma`"
" 和 `dram.size = 40GB`。"

msgid ""
"Wait for the APIs on P0:8000, P2:8000, and all sixteen Decode APIs on\n"
"        ports 8000-8003 to answer `GET /v1/models`. Use `curl --noproxy '*'`\n"
"        for these checks when HTTP proxies are configured. Start the proxy\n"
"        on P0 or another reachable host:"
msgstr ""
"等待 P0:8000、P2:8000 上的 API 以及端口 8000-8003 上的全部十六个 Decode API 响应 `GET "
"/v1/models`。当配置了 HTTP 代理时，请使用 `curl --noproxy '*'` 执行这些检查。在 P0 "
"或其他可访问的主机上启动代理："

msgid ""
"- The launcher passes `$1` = visible devices, `$2` = API port, `$3` = global\n"
"  DP size, `$4` = DP rank, `$5` = DP master IP, `$6` = DP RPC port, and\n"
"  `$7` = TP size to `run_dp_template.sh`.\n"
"- `--decode-context-parallel-size`: 16 on Prefill and 8 on Decode;\n"
"  `--prefill-context-parallel-size` remains 1 and\n"
"  `--cp-kv-cache-interleave-size` is 128 on both roles.\n"
"- `--max-num-batched-tokens`: 8192 on Prefill and 192 on Decode.\n"
"  `--max-num-seqs`: 64 on Prefill and 32 on Decode. These are scheduler\n"
"  limits; start the 1M workload with one concurrent request and increase\n"
"  concurrency according to available KV cache capacity.\n"
"- MTP uses `deepseek_mtp` with an eager draft: 1 speculative token on\n"
"  Prefill and 5 on Decode. Decode uses `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph mode.\n"
"- `MooncakeConnectorV1` uses `kv_producer` on Prefill and `kv_consumer`\n"
"  on Decode, with the same `prefill: DP2/TP16` and `decode: DP4/TP8`\n"
"  topology on both roles. This example does not enable MemCache pooling.\n"
"- Both roles use int8 KV and indexer KV caches. Prefill enables DSA CP,\n"
"  fused MC2 and FlashComm1; Decode enables fused MC2, MLAPO and the\n"
"  recomputation scheduler. See [Performance Tuning](#9-performance-tuning).\n"
"- `--kv-cache-dtype turboquant_4bit_nc`: Enables 4-bit TurboQuant\n"
"  quantization for the SFA packed main KV cache, as an alternative to\n"
"  `--kv-cache-dtype int8`. It requires an A2/A3 device, cannot be\n"
"  combined with the C8 cache, and in Prefill-Decode disaggregation the\n"
"  Mooncake option `\"use_ascend_direct\"` must be `false`."
msgstr ""
"- 启动器将 `$1` = 可见设备、`$2` = API 端口、`$3` = 全局 DP size、`$4` = DP rank、`$5` = DP master IP、`$6` = DP RPC 端口、`$7` = TP size 传递给 `run_dp_template.sh`。\n"
"- `--decode-context-parallel-size`：Prefill 上为 16，Decode 上为 8；\n"
"  `--prefill-context-parallel-size` 保持为 1，\n"
"  `--cp-kv-cache-interleave-size` 在两种角色上均为 128。\n"
"- `--max-num-batched-tokens`：Prefill 上为 8192，Decode 上为 192。\n"
"  `--max-num-seqs`：Prefill 上为 64，Decode 上为 32。这些是调度器\n"
"  限制；请以一个并发请求启动 1M 工作负载，并根据可用的 KV cache 容量\n"
"  增加并发数。\n"
"- MTP 使用 `deepseek_mtp` 并采用 eager draft：Prefill 上为 1 个投机 token，\n"
"  Decode 上为 5 个。Decode 使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图模式。\n"
"- `MooncakeConnectorV1` 在 Prefill 上使用 `kv_producer`，在 Decode 上使用\n"
"  `kv_consumer`，两种角色均采用相同的 `prefill: DP2/TP16` 和\n"
"  `decode: DP4/TP8` 拓扑。本示例未启用 MemCache 池化。\n"
"- 两种角色均使用 int8 KV 和 indexer KV cache。Prefill 启用 DSA CP、\n"
"  fused MC2 和 FlashComm1；Decode 启用 fused MC2、MLAPO 和\n"
"  重计算调度器。参见 [性能调优](#9-performance-tuning)。\n"
"- `--kv-cache-dtype turboquant_4bit_nc`：为 SFA 打包的主 KV cache 启用\n"
"  4-bit TurboQuant 量化，作为 `--kv-cache-dtype int8` 的替代方案。\n"
"  它需要 A2/A3 设备，不能与 C8 cache 组合使用，并且在 Prefill-Decode\n"
"  分离部署中，Mooncake 选项 `\"use_ascend_direct\"` 必须为 `false`。"
